/Title (The performance of anomaly detection models depends not only on the algorithms used, but also on how those algorithms are configured. In this project, a systematic Grid Search process was applied to the window size and threshold value \(k\) parameters used in the Z-Score and Dynamic Thresholding methods. Multiple parameter combinations were evaluated to identify the configurations that provided the most effective anomaly detection performance.)
