/Title (The Z-Score method operates using a fixed threshold. The Z-score is calculated based on the mean and standard deviation within a defined window; when the score exceeds the specified threshold \(|z| > 1.5\), the transaction is classified as an anomaly.)
/Dest [21 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 942 0 R
/Next 948 0 R
