<<
/Title (A Rolling Mean calculates the average of values within a defined window to capture the underlying trend over time. Rolling Standard Deviation \(Rolling Std\) measures the degree of variability within the same window. Together, these rolling statistics form the basis of the Z-Score and Dynamic Thresholding methods.)
/Dest [17 0 R /Fit]
/Parent 960 0 R
>>
